{"product_id":"vaporesso-xros-3-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso XROS 3 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso XROS 3 Pod System, featuring a 1000mAh battery, 0.6-1.0ohm resistance range, and is compatible with all previous XROS variants.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-xros-replacement-pods\" title=\"Vaporesso XROS Replacement Pods\"\u003eVaporesso XROS Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eConstructed from durable stainless steel, the chassis of the XROS 3 is impervious to light falls and drops, preventing any damage to the delicate inner-workings. In addition, the 2mL refillable pods can hold and vaporize your favorite eJuices or nicotine salts and can be used with all members of the XROS family. Adopting the AXON chipset from higher end Vaporesso Starter Kits and Pod Systems, the XROS 3 Pod System is now capable of outputting in Pulse mode. This produces more stable and constant flavor, as the chipset within checks the coil multiple times per second to ensure constant power delivery.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso XROS 3 Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 115.1mm by 23.6mm by 13.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput: Constant Voltage Based\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-1.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Zinc-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Button-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: XROS 3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top - Dual Fill Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMore Info: Chipset: AXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso XROS 3 Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm XROS 3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.0ohm XROS 3 Mesh Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Reminder Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531765817399,"sku":"V XROS 3 Pod System","price":4100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_xros_3_pod_system_-_black_1.png?v=1741709788","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-xros-3-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




